  "details": "In my case, I have an image gallery with 13 images that are regularly reloaded at random and then displayed for a certain time. When the time is up, 13 new images are loaded.\n\nThe gallery has different themes that can be selected in a menu. If a new theme is selected, the current loading process should be aborted and the queue with the remaining image downloads should be deleted.\n\nHowever, it is currently not possible to delete the queue and therefore it can happen that you have to wait 13 * 5 seconds (over a minute) until the images of the selected theme can be loaded.",
